data: {"id": "5ed9a76615e54074-thinking-parallel_evidence-2429", "run_id": "5ed9a76615e54074", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 已采集事实（本轮真实工具结果）\n\n- **实体身份与当前状态**：Pod `aiops-case-v12/workload`（UID `7872555d-068b-461f-bde4-bab42d1ce9c8`）仍然存在， nodeName=`node2`。`kubectl get pod`/YAML 显示 `phase: Running`，但 `kubectl describe` 报告 `status: Terminating`；这表明对象在 etcd 层面已标记删除（见 deletionTimestamp），kubelet 正在进行容器停止，但 Pod 对象尚未从 API 服务器移除。\n- **deletionTimestamp 与宽限期**：`deletionTimestamp: 2026-09-14T07:14:11Z`，`terminationGracePeriodSeconds: 3900`（65 分钟），`deletionGracePeriodSeconds: 3900`。kubelet 事件显示 `Stopping container app` 发生在 51 秒", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789366222756, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

